  "extend_content": "成功解开谜题后，量子星云影响的设备恢复正常，同时从中浮现出一张碎纸片。\n\n<img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/cf886694db784f05920fecf99ea0fb34.webp\" alt=\"fragment\" style=\"max-width: 100%\" />",
